# ============================================================
# KEBIJAKAN STARTERPACK: catatan .md = LOKAL, DI LUAR GIT.
# Catatan kerja (CLAUDE/BACKLOG/DECISIONS/CHANGELOG/profil/
# FEATURE-SCOPE/features/docs/_archive/.roo) = instruksi kerja
# user+AI, bukan artefak produk. Repo tetap bersih & aman dibagikan.
# Auto-load CLAUDE.md tetap jalan dari disk.
#
# ⚠️ KONSEKUENSI YANG WAJIB DIURUS (jangan diabaikan):
#   1. BACKUP catatan = tanggung jawab manual (Time Machine/sejenis).
#      Git BUKAN backup-mu lagi. Laptop hilang = konteks hilang.
#   2. SERAH-TERIMA: clone repo TIDAK membawa konteks — catatan harus
#      disalin manual. Prosedurnya di HANDOVER.md §7.
#
# 🔓 PENGECUALIAN — dokumen yang DITEGAKKAN skrip di Git wajib IKUT Git.
#    Contoh: DESIGN.md ditegakkan scripts/design-lint.mjs + baseline JSON.
#    Penegak di git tapi aturannya cuma di laptop = pincang.
#    Cara: hapus barisnya dari daftar di bawah + tulis alasannya di sini.
# ============================================================

# TETAP IKUT GIT (sengaja, jangan ditambahkan ke daftar bawah):
#   HANDOVER.md        — tripwire: memberi tahu orang yang meng-clone bahwa
#                        konteksnya TIDAK ada di repo & cara memintanya.
#   prototype/         — mockup = "kontrak visual" yang mengunci Mode B.
#   access/MANIFEST.md — indeks kredensial TANPA nilai.
#   .claude/skills/    — amunisi kerja, harus ikut saat repo dipakai di mesin lain.

# --- Catatan kerja (lokal saja) ---
/CLAUDE.md
/START-HERE.md
/BACKLOG.md
/DECISIONS.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/CLIENT-PROFILE.md
/PROBLEM-GOAL.md
/FEATURE-SCOPE.md
/features/
/docs/
/_archive/
/context/
# Config + rules LLM non-Claude (lintas-LLM) — lokal, sejalan dgn di atas.
/.roo/

# OS & editor
.DS_Store

# Dependencies & build
node_modules/
dist/
.next/

# RAHASIA — jangan pernah di-commit (indeksnya tanpa nilai: access/MANIFEST.md)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
access/secrets/

# Per-mesin (bukan bagian proyek)
.claude/settings.local.json

# impeccable-ignore-start
# Output ephemeral skill impeccable (screenshot, state live-mode, cache).
# Artefak bersama TETAP di-commit: .impeccable/config.json, live/config.json,
# design.json, critique/*.md.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
.impeccable/*.png
.impeccable/live/server.json
.impeccable/live/sessions/
.impeccable/live/previews/
.impeccable/live/annotations/
.impeccable/live/cache/
.impeccable/live/manual-edit-apply-transaction.json
.impeccable/live/manual-edit-events.jsonl
.impeccable/live/manual-edit-evidence/
.impeccable/live/pending-manual-edits.json
.impeccable/live/deferred-svelte-component-accepts.json
.impeccable/live/*.png
# impeccable-ignore-end
